Version: [current]
Command: monochange ci

Evaluate conditional CI gates, verify main branch outcomes, and view repo-scoped analytics

[1m[97mUsage:[0m [93mmonochange ci[0m [95m[OPTIONS][0m [95m<COMMAND>[0m

[1m[96mCommands:[0m
  [93mauth[0m       Manage repository-scoped authentication for CI history and analytics
  [93mdecide[0m     Evaluate whether configured CI jobs should run (y/n) from [ci] rules and the workspace graph
  [93mverify[0m     Record actual CI job outcomes and update closed-loop learned rules
  [93manalytics[0m  Compute protected CI decision accuracy, false negatives/positives, and duration analytics
  [93mhistory[0m    View protected repository CI gate decision and verification history
  [93mcheck[0m      Validate [ci] configuration and its wiring into GitHub workflow files

